  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_header.webp\" alt=\"Banner Header\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_promo2.webp\" alt=\"Banner Bisecthosting\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_overview.webp\" alt=\"Banner Overview\"></h2>\n<p>准备好开始你的《驯龙高手》（HTTYD）冒险了吗？跳入一个充满巨龙的世界，就像《驯龙高手》一样！在你的世界中骑乘、驯服并繁殖各种龙。在探索最深层的地牢时与它们并肩作战，或者骑着它们悠闲地欣赏日落。使用维京武器和盔甲在你的世界中翱翔和探索，尽情掠夺直到心满意足。在最高的火山峰顶安顿下来，喝一杯麦酒来增强自己！这一切都在<strong>贝利克的利爪（Claws of Berk）</strong>中成为可能。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/new-berks-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fnew-berks-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-plural-alt\"></a></p>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SR_HLmOQy1s?si=w83UfReiLN4lH3WV\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_features.webp\" alt=\"Banner Features\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>地牢</strong> - 感觉充满冒险精神吗？是时候挑战一个复杂的地下城了，从它的顶峰一直深入到底层。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>独特的世界生成</strong> - 在高耸的山脉和广阔的平原上和平飞翔，或者或许在深海表面滑行。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>维京人及更多</strong> - 这是什么？你发现了一艘维京船和一个维京村庄，这个精彩的世界还会为你准备什么惊喜呢。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>龙</strong> - 野生动物可能有点危险，但别担心，这些飞行的蜥蜴更喜欢大餐。拥有超过50种不同的物种和超过1000种变体，你能驯服从最小到最大的这些壮观生物吗。</li>\n<li><strong>还有更多精彩……！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_discord.webp\" alt=\"Modpack Discord\"></a></p>\n<h3>标准免责声明</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是YouTube博主或内容创作者，正在游玩此整合包，请在描述中添加链接指向本页面，以便人们知道你使用的是哪个整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允许在Modrinth或CurseForge上重新上传此整合包或其任何修改版本，这包括重定向到其他任何网站。</strong>（<em>除非获得我的明确许可</em>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>查看这些惊人的视频！</h2>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jPAlYvDd41I?si=pM9N9N6aCFY686Bx\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XZCNY00iXv8?si=IvpPY6fK1P9QncNU\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0HHccMlR5Hw?si=Y8INHtccITw2fStF\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ha7mUe6EEYE?si=ubYwNR71biA4es5H\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R8E_eqNturI?si=cx1tv1Pbs29bS72n\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0yrkfOdBVPE?si=J4WdnEDDpkLSXsM3\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bAQK2olfPNI?si=xhUWJRK31TxUkr5X\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PiED62zs59Y?si=MYQ57nWfi-ku3BLf\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>",
